<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-033" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:text" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:text:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓公</persName>臥語曰：「作此寂寂，將為<rs id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:text:m0014" type="unresolved">文</rs>、<rs id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:text:m0016" type="unresolved">景</rs>所笑！」既而屈起坐曰：「既不能流芳後世，亦不足復遺臭萬載邪？」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:note" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:note:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>既以雄武專朝，任兼將相，其不臣之心，形于音跡。曾臥對親僚，撫枕而起曰：『為爾寂寂，為<rs id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:note:m0044" type="unresolved">文</rs>、<rs id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:note:m0046" type="unresolved">景</rs>所笑！』眾莫敢對。</p>
</text>
